@title 3D Heat: a fan inside the cabinet goes into a Quick 3D run and the run finishes
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Lane H8, 3D solver: the fans of the Fans inside section are mapped into the 3D grid. Same walk as 1602 with one fan added before the run; the run must finish and show no error. Compare with 1602 (no fan).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
# Opening Heat on a small cabinet starts an automatic run, which greys out the Quality row: stop it first.
click_text Cancel
wait 10
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
scroll 170 560 -400
wait 10
click_text "Add fan inside"
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 200
expect_not "Preliminary"
move 700 650
wait 10
shot fan-run-done
check_layout
